{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/"},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/c6377dd9ce6a1c2cd100eb4344e843eb4639b9ed26f84643f77680e9eb454c4b/$/index","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--i1tFVQxYH1GB60w1PTsU_--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/c73d3c99036016c1.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f51b7a4e7e383c5e.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-bbd7aa6c52a53d13.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-6b3153e5c3ed6b3e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/page-39992e43f23ce678.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Krillion Unlimited Game — Independent Practice Dive</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Play an independent rare-answer trivia practice game with seven prompts, a 25-second timer, and an original starter question bank.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex, follow\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"wrap header-inner\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"KrillionEndless home\">KrillionEndless</a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#game\">Unlimited</a><a href=\"/archive/\">Archive</a><a href=\"/#faq-section\">Answers</a><a href=\"/#planned-pages\">Packs</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"wrap\" id=\"top\"><section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-waves\"><path d=\"M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5c2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path><path d=\"M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path><path d=\"M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path></svg> INDEPENDENT PRACTICE MODE</div><h1>Krillion Unlimited</h1><p class=\"sub\">No daily limit — play an original practice dive whenever you like.</p></section><div class=\"ad-slot\" aria-label=\"Reserved advertising placement\">Advertisement</div><section class=\"game\" id=\"game\" aria-label=\"Play the independent practice game\"><div class=\"intro-state\"><div class=\"game-top\"><span class=\"dive\">PRACTICE DIVE</span><span>7 prompts · 25 seconds each</span></div><div class=\"intro-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-waves\"><path d=\"M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5c2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path><path d=\"M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path><path d=\"M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1\"></path></svg></div><h2>Ready to dive?</h2><p>Answer seven original prompts. Accepted answers receive demo points from our hand-curated practice list.</p><button class=\"btn\">Start dive <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></section><nav class=\"quicklinks\" aria-label=\"Explore more\"><a href=\"#faq-section\">Answers &amp; hints <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#archive-section\">Practice archive <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#planned-pages\">Geography pack <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#planned-pages\">Games like Krillion <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></nav><div class=\"ad-slot\">Advertisement</div><section class=\"content-section\"><h2>How to play this practice dive</h2><p>Answer seven short, open-ended prompts. Each prompt has a 25-second timer. If your answer matches one of the accepted aliases in this prototype’s question bank, you earn its preset demo score. If it does not match, you can try again before time runs out.</p><div class=\"steps-grid\"><article><span>01</span><h3>Read the prompt</h3><p>Check the category carefully and think of a specific answer that fits.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Submit one answer</h3><p>Accepted spelling variants are supported for a small number of answers.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Review your score</h3><p>At the end, review your points and see which prompts you answered.</p></article></div><h3 class=\"subheading\">Practice scoring tiers</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Practice label</th><th>Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Plankton</td><td>Common demo answer</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Too Clever</td><td>Common demo answer</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>Schooler</td><td>Specific demo answer</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>Rare</td><td>Specific demo answer</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Deep Cut</td><td>Less obvious demo answer</td><td>85</td></tr><tr><td>One in a Krillion</td><td>Less obvious demo answer</td><td>100</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"small-note\">These points are manually assigned to this prototype’s sample answers for testing gameplay. They are not calculated from real player submissions.</p></section><section class=\"content-section\" id=\"archive-section\"><h2>Practice archive</h2><p>This prototype currently uses a local sample question bank. Historical rounds, dates, answer pages, and themed packs will be added after the question data is verified and expanded.</p><div class=\"archive-placeholder\"><strong>Archive is not published yet</strong><span>We won’t show invented historical dates or pretend these are official daily dives.</span></div></section><section class=\"content-section\" id=\"faq-section\"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><details open=\"\"><summary>Is this the official Krillion game?</summary><p>No. This is an independent prototype for practice and experimentation. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the operator of the official game.</p></details><details><summary>Are these official answers or rarity scores?</summary><p>No. This starter version uses an original sample question bank and manually assigned demo tiers. It does not use official answer data or live player-frequency data.</p></details><details><summary>Why might my correct answer be rejected?</summary><p>This is a small demo list, not a complete knowledge database. A factually valid answer can be missing until the answer bank and its accepted aliases are reviewed and expanded.</p></details><details><summary>Can I replay it?</summary><p>Yes. Select “Play another dive” after the results screen to start another randomized practice round.</p></details><details><summary>Does this site store my answers?</summary><p>This prototype checks answers in your browser and does not send them to a server. Analytics, ads, or accounts should only be added with a matching privacy notice.</p></details><details><summary>Is it free?</summary><p>Yes — free to play, no account, no download. The site is supported by ads, nothing else.</p></details><details><summary>When does the official daily dive reset?</summary><p>At midnight UTC. The dive numbering here matches the official one, so you can always cross-check against the <a href=\"/archive/\">archive</a>.</p></details><details><summary>Can I share my result?</summary><p>Yes. After a dive, copy the result line and paste it anywhere — it lists your answers and your score without spoiling the prompts.</p></details></section><section class=\"content-section\" id=\"planned-pages\"><h2>More practice pages</h2><p>Answer guides, historical dives, themed packs, and similar-game pages are planned, but are not implemented in this homepage MVP yet.</p></section><div class=\"ad-slot\">Advertisement</div></main><footer class=\"foot\"><div class=\"wrap\"><nav><a href=\"/about/\">About</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms/\">Terms</a></nav><p><strong>krillionendless.org</strong> is an independent, fan-made project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the official Krillion game at krillion.io. Game mechanics are described here for informational purposes only.</p><p>© 2026 <!-- -->krillionendless.org</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f51b7a4e7e383c5e.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1959,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n5:I[4605,[\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-39992e43f23ce678.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[4431,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\na:I[5278,[],\\\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\\\"]\\nc:I[4431,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[4431,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\nf:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n11:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/c73d3c99036016c1.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"i1tFVQxYH1GB60w1PTsU-\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/c73d3c99036016c1.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"templateScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"notFound\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"404: This page could not be found.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"style\\\":{\\\"fontFamily\\\":\\\"syst